{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "# 🧩 WUfB - Driver Compliance Report\n\nQuesto workbook traccia lo stato di installazione e gli alert dei **driver e firmware** distribuiti via Windows Update for Business.\n\n**Sorgenti**: `UCClientUpdateStatus`, `UCServiceUpdateStatus`, `UCUpdateAlert`, `UCClient` (filtro `UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"`).\n\n> **Filtro Tipo PC:** di default vengono mostrati solo i **PC Modern** (Windows 11; esclusi i Windows 10). Imposta *Tipo PC = Tutti i PC* per includere anche i Windows 10."
      },
      "name": "text-header"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "d2a2e001-1111-4a1a-b1c1-111111111111",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                {
                  "durationMs": 604800000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 1209600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 2592000000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 7776000000
                }
              ],
              "allowCustom": true
            },
            "value": {
              "durationMs": 2592000000
            },
            "label": "Intervallo Temporale"
          },
          {
            "id": "d2a2e001-2222-4a1a-b1c1-222222222222",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "UpdateManufacturerFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated > ago(90d)\n| where UpdateCategory == 'DriverUpdate'\n| distinct UpdateManufacturer\n| where isnotempty(UpdateManufacturer)\n| order by UpdateManufacturer asc",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "Vendor Driver"
          },
          {
            "id": "d2a2e001-3333-4a1a-b1c1-333333333333",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DeviceManufacturerFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated > ago(90d)\n| distinct DeviceManufacturer\n| where isnotempty(DeviceManufacturer)\n| order by DeviceManufacturer asc",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "OEM Device"
          },
          {
            "id": "d2a2e001-4444-4a1a-b1c1-444444444444",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DeviceModelFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated > ago(90d)\n| where '*' in ({DeviceManufacturerFilter}) or DeviceManufacturer in ({DeviceManufacturerFilter})\n| distinct DeviceModel\n| where isnotempty(DeviceModel)\n| order by DeviceModel asc",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "Modello Device"
          },
          {
            "id": "d2a2e001-5555-4a1a-b1c1-555555555555",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "ClientStateFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "jsonData": "[\"Installed\",\"Installing\",\"Offering\",\"OnHold\",\"Canceled\",\"Unknown\"]",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "Stato Client"
          },
          {
            "id": "d2a2e001-6666-4a1a-b1c1-666666666666",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "OSVersionFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated > ago(90d)\n| distinct OSVersion\n| where isnotempty(OSVersion)\n| order by OSVersion desc",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "OS Version"
          },
          {
            "id": "d2b2f002-9999-4b2b-c2d2-999999999999",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "ModernOnly",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": []
            },
            "jsonData": "[\n  { \"value\": \"modern\", \"label\": \"Solo PC Modern (esclude Windows 10)\", \"selected\": true },\n  { \"value\": \"all\", \"label\": \"Tutti i PC\" }\n]",
            "queryType": 8,
            "label": "Tipo PC"
          },
          {
            "id": "d2a2e001-7777-4a1a-b1c1-777777777777",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DeviceNameFilter",
            "type": 1,
            "value": "",
            "label": "Filtro Device (contains)"
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "parameters"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 📊 Compliance per singolo driver e modello device\n\nOgni riga rappresenta uno specifico driver. La percentuale è calcolata esclusivamente sui device che hanno riportato uno stato per quel driver; i contatori degli stati sono quindi mutuamente esclusivi."
      },
      "name": "text-section-summary"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _vendor   = dynamic([{UpdateManufacturerFilter}]);\nlet _oem      = dynamic([{DeviceManufacturerFilter}]);\nlet _model    = dynamic([{DeviceModelFilter}]);\nlet _state    = dynamic([{ClientStateFilter}]);\nlet _osVer    = dynamic([{OSVersionFilter}]);\nlet _device   = \"{DeviceNameFilter}\";\nlet _modernOnly = \"{ModernOnly}\";\nlet clientInfo = UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId\n| project AzureADDeviceId, DeviceManufacturer, DeviceModel, OSVersion;\nUCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| extend DeviceName = iff(isempty(DeviceName), AzureADDeviceId, DeviceName)\n| where \"*\" in (_vendor) or UpdateManufacturer in (_vendor)\n| where _device == \"\" or DeviceName contains _device\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| where \"*\" in (_state) or ClientState in (_state)\n| join kind=leftouter clientInfo on AzureADDeviceId\n| where \"*\" in (_oem) or DeviceManufacturer in (_oem)\n| where \"*\" in (_model) or DeviceModel in (_model)\n| where \"*\" in (_osVer) or OSVersion in (_osVer)\n| where _modernOnly == \"all\" or isempty(OSVersion) or not(OSVersion startswith \"Windows 10\")\n| summarize\n    ReportingDevices = dcount(AzureADDeviceId),\n    Installed = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"Installed\"),\n    Installing = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"Installing\"),\n    Offering = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"Offering\"),\n    OnHold = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"OnHold\"),\n    Canceled = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"Canceled\"),\n    Unknown = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"Unknown\")\n    by UpdateId, UpdateManufacturer, UpdateDisplayName, DeviceManufacturer, DeviceModel\n| extend PercentInstalledReported = round(todouble(Installed) / todouble(ReportingDevices) * 100, 1)\n| project\n    UpdateId,\n    UpdateManufacturer,\n    UpdateDisplayName,\n    DeviceManufacturer,\n    DeviceModel,\n    ReportingDevices,\n    Installed,\n    Installing,\n    Offering,\n    OnHold,\n    Canceled,\n    Unknown,\n    PercentInstalledReported\n| order by ReportingDevices desc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Compliance per driver tra device con stato riportato",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "PercentInstalledReported",
              "formatter": 8,
              "formatOptions": {
                "min": 0,
                "max": 100,
                "palette": "redGreen"
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true,
          "sortBy": [
            {
              "itemKey": "ReportingDevices",
              "sortOrder": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "grid-driver-compliance-summary"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 🖥️ Stato Installazione per Device + Driver"
      },
      "name": "text-section-device-detail"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _vendor   = dynamic([{UpdateManufacturerFilter}]);\nlet _oem      = dynamic([{DeviceManufacturerFilter}]);\nlet _model    = dynamic([{DeviceModelFilter}]);\nlet _state    = dynamic([{ClientStateFilter}]);\nlet _osVer    = dynamic([{OSVersionFilter}]);\nlet _device   = \"{DeviceNameFilter}\";\nlet _modernOnly = \"{ModernOnly}\";\nlet clientInfo = UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId\n| project AzureADDeviceId, DeviceManufacturer, DeviceModel, OSVersion, OSBuild, OSEdition, LastWUScanTime;\nUCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| extend DeviceName = iff(isempty(DeviceName), AzureADDeviceId, DeviceName)\n| where \"*\" in (_vendor) or UpdateManufacturer in (_vendor)\n| where _device == \"\" or DeviceName contains _device\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| where \"*\" in (_state) or ClientState in (_state)\n| join kind=leftouter clientInfo on AzureADDeviceId\n| where \"*\" in (_oem) or DeviceManufacturer in (_oem)\n| where \"*\" in (_model) or DeviceModel in (_model)\n| where \"*\" in (_osVer) or OSVersion in (_osVer)\n| where _modernOnly == \"all\" or isempty(OSVersion) or not(OSVersion startswith \"Windows 10\")\n| project\n    DeviceName,\n    DeviceManufacturer,\n    DeviceModel,\n    OSVersion,\n    OSBuild,\n    UpdateManufacturer,\n    UpdateDisplayName,\n    UpdateClassification,\n    TargetVersion,\n    ClientState,\n    ClientSubstate,\n    OfferReceivedTime,\n    RestartRequiredTime,\n    UpdateInstalledTime,\n    LastWUScanTime,\n    TimeGenerated\n| order by DeviceName asc, UpdateManufacturer asc, UpdateDisplayName asc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Stato Driver per Device",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "ClientState",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Installed",
                    "representation": "success",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Installing",
                    "representation": "2",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Offering",
                    "representation": "warning",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "OnHold",
                    "representation": "4",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Canceled",
                    "representation": "cancelled",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Unknown",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "UpdateClassification",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Drivers",
                    "representation": "1",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Firmware",
                    "representation": "2",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true,
          "sortBy": [
            {
              "itemKey": "DeviceName",
              "sortOrder": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "grid-driver-device-detail"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## ❌ Driver in Errore o On Hold\n\nElenco dei driver in OnHold o con alert attivo. La correlazione usa AzureADDeviceId + UpdateId, chiave specifica degli aggiornamenti driver."
      },
      "name": "text-section-errors"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _vendor   = dynamic([{UpdateManufacturerFilter}]);\nlet _oem      = dynamic([{DeviceManufacturerFilter}]);\nlet _model    = dynamic([{DeviceModelFilter}]);\nlet _osVer    = dynamic([{OSVersionFilter}]);\nlet _device   = \"{DeviceNameFilter}\";\nlet _modernOnly = \"{ModernOnly}\";\nlet clientInfo = UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId\n| project AzureADDeviceId, DeviceManufacturer, DeviceModel, OSVersion;\nlet updates = UCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| extend DeviceName = iff(isempty(DeviceName), AzureADDeviceId, DeviceName)\n| where \"*\" in (_vendor) or UpdateManufacturer in (_vendor)\n| where _device == \"\" or DeviceName contains _device\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| join kind=leftouter clientInfo on AzureADDeviceId\n| where \"*\" in (_oem) or DeviceManufacturer in (_oem)\n| where \"*\" in (_model) or DeviceModel in (_model)\n| where \"*\" in (_osVer) or OSVersion in (_osVer)\n| where _modernOnly == \"all\" or isempty(OSVersion) or not(OSVersion startswith \"Windows 10\")\n| project DeviceName, AzureADDeviceId, DeviceManufacturer, DeviceModel,\n          UpdateManufacturer, UpdateDisplayName, UpdateClassification,\n          UpdateId, TargetVersion, ClientState, ClientSubstate;\nlet alertInfo = UCUpdateAlert\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| where AlertStatus == \"Active\"\n\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, AlertSubtype\n| project AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, AlertSubtype, AlertClassification, AlertStatus, ErrorCode, ErrorSymName, Recommendation, URL;\nupdates\n| join kind=leftouter alertInfo on AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| where ClientState == \"OnHold\" or isnotempty(AlertSubtype)\n| project\n    DeviceName,\n    DeviceManufacturer,\n    DeviceModel,\n    UpdateManufacturer,\n    UpdateDisplayName,\n    UpdateClassification,\n    TargetVersion,\n    ClientState,\n    ClientSubstate,\n    AlertSubtype,\n    AlertClassification,\n    AlertStatus,\n    ErrorCode,\n    ErrorSymName,\n    Recommendation,\n    URL\n| order by DeviceName asc, UpdateManufacturer asc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Driver con errori o OnHold",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "ClientState",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "OnHold",
                    "representation": "4",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Canceled",
                    "representation": "cancelled",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "AlertClassification",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Error",
                    "representation": "3",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Warning",
                    "representation": "warning",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "URL",
              "formatter": 7,
              "formatOptions": {
                "linkTarget": "Url",
                "linkLabel": "KB / docs"
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true,
          "sortBy": [
            {
              "itemKey": "DeviceName",
              "sortOrder": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "grid-driver-errors"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 🚦 Stato Service-Side e Alert per Driver\n\nVista lato Deployment Service e alert correlati tramite AzureADDeviceId + UpdateId."
      },
      "name": "text-section-service-alerts"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _vendor   = dynamic([{UpdateManufacturerFilter}]);\nlet _oem      = dynamic([{DeviceManufacturerFilter}]);\nlet _model    = dynamic([{DeviceModelFilter}]);\nlet _state    = dynamic([{ClientStateFilter}]);\nlet _osVer    = dynamic([{OSVersionFilter}]);\nlet _device   = \"{DeviceNameFilter}\";\nlet _modernOnly = \"{ModernOnly}\";\nlet clientInfo = UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId\n| project AzureADDeviceId, DeviceManufacturer, DeviceModel, OSVersion;\nlet updates = UCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| extend DeviceName = iff(isempty(DeviceName), AzureADDeviceId, DeviceName)\n| where \"*\" in (_vendor) or UpdateManufacturer in (_vendor)\n| where _device == \"\" or DeviceName contains _device\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| where \"*\" in (_state) or ClientState in (_state)\n| join kind=leftouter clientInfo on AzureADDeviceId\n| where \"*\" in (_oem) or DeviceManufacturer in (_oem)\n| where \"*\" in (_model) or DeviceModel in (_model)\n| where \"*\" in (_osVer) or OSVersion in (_osVer)\n| where _modernOnly == \"all\" or isempty(OSVersion) or not(OSVersion startswith \"Windows 10\")\n| project DeviceName, AzureADDeviceId, UpdateManufacturer, UpdateDisplayName,\n          UpdateId, TargetVersion, ClientState, ClientSubstate;\nlet serviceInfo = UCServiceUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| project AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, ServiceState, ServiceSubstate, OfferReadyTime, DeploymentName, PolicyName;\nlet alertInfo = UCUpdateAlert\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, AlertSubtype\n| project AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, AlertSubtype, AlertClassification, AlertStatus, ErrorCode;\nupdates\n| join kind=leftouter serviceInfo on AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| join kind=leftouter alertInfo on AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| extend Note = case(\n    ClientSubstate in (\"PendingRestart\", \"RestartRequired\", \"PendingReboot\"), \"AwaitingRestart\",\n    ClientState == \"Installed\" and (isempty(AlertSubtype) or AlertStatus != \"Active\"), \"OK - Installed\",\n    ClientState == \"Installing\" and (isempty(AlertSubtype) or AlertStatus != \"Active\"), strcat(\"In progress: \", ClientSubstate),\n    ClientState == \"Offering\" and (isempty(AlertSubtype) or AlertStatus != \"Active\"), \"Offered, not yet started\",\n    ClientState == \"OnHold\", \"On hold (safeguard/policy)\",\n    \"\"\n)\n| project\n    DeviceName,\n    UpdateManufacturer,\n    UpdateDisplayName,\n    TargetVersion,\n    ClientState,\n    ClientSubstate,\n    ServiceState,\n    ServiceSubstate,\n    DeploymentName,\n    PolicyName,\n    AlertSubtype,\n    AlertClassification,\n    AlertStatus,\n    ErrorCode,\n    Note\n| order by DeviceName asc, UpdateManufacturer asc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Stato Service-Side e Alert per Driver",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "ServiceState",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Offering",
                    "representation": "success",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Pending",
                    "representation": "pending",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "OnHold",
                    "representation": "4",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Canceled",
                    "representation": "cancelled",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "AlertClassification",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Error",
                    "representation": "3",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Warning",
                    "representation": "warning",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "AlertStatus",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Active",
                    "representation": "3",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Resolved",
                    "representation": "success",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true,
          "sortBy": [
            {
              "itemKey": "DeviceName",
              "sortOrder": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "grid-driver-service-alerts"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 📦 Inventario Driver Installati"
      },
      "name": "text-section-inventory"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _vendor   = dynamic([{UpdateManufacturerFilter}]);\nlet _device   = \"{DeviceNameFilter}\";\nlet _modernOnly = \"{ModernOnly}\";\nlet clientInfo = UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId\n| project AzureADDeviceId, OSVersion;\nUCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| where ClientState == \"Installed\"\n| extend DeviceName = iff(isempty(DeviceName), AzureADDeviceId, DeviceName)\n| where \"*\" in (_vendor) or UpdateManufacturer in (_vendor)\n| where _device == \"\" or DeviceName contains _device\n| join kind=leftouter clientInfo on AzureADDeviceId\n| where _modernOnly == \"all\" or isempty(OSVersion) or not(OSVersion startswith \"Windows 10\")\n| summarize\n    Installations = dcount(AzureADDeviceId),\n    LastInstall = max(UpdateInstalledTime),\n    FirstSeen = min(UpdateInstalledTime)\n    by UpdateManufacturer, UpdateDisplayName, TargetVersion\n| order by Installations desc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Driver installati nella finestra selezionata",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "Installations",
              "formatter": 4,
              "formatOptions": {
                "min": 0,
                "palette": "blue"
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true,
          "sortBy": [
            {
              "itemKey": "Installations",
              "sortOrder": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "grid-driver-inventory"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "---\n### Note\n- I dati riflettono l'ultimo stato noto per AzureADDeviceId + UpdateId.\n- Gli errori sono ricostruiti tramite UCUpdateAlert.\n- Le correlazioni service/alert usano AzureADDeviceId + UpdateId.\n- PercentInstalledReported usa come denominatore solo i device che hanno riportato quello specifico driver."
      },
      "name": "text-footer"
    }
  ],
  "fallbackResourceIds": [],
  "$schema": "https://github.com/Microsoft/Application-Insights-Workbooks/blob/master/schema/workbook.json",
  "styleSettings": {},
  "fromTemplateId": "custom-wufb-driver-compliance"
}
